# What the Semgrep scan (.github/workflows/semgrep.yml) skips. A .semgrepignore REPLACES Semgrep's
# built-in list, so that list is repeated here first.
:include .gitignore
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
test/
tests/
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

# The OpenAPI generator's Mustache templates write Kotlin source, not HTML: their triple braces are
# code generation, so the template-escaping rules do not apply (41 false positives, 15 Nov 2026).
mobile/welcome-screen/android-preview-project/app/openapi-templates/

# Design references and plans: excerpts of the design kit, not code that ships (one excerpt is not a
# complete module and cannot be parsed).
docs/
design_handoff_showup/
